    "title": "Local authoring services",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Experimental synchronous loopback APIs. Separate bearer tokens per service. Maximum JSON request body 200000 bytes; whitespace-only publication/transcript fields rejected. Preview reviews expire in 1800 seconds. Health is liveness, not model readiness. No automatic publishing."
